WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.389 --> 00:00:12.260
Jousting is the official sport of the US state
of Maryland.

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:26.240
35 years after leaving school, the majority
of people can still identify 90% of their

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.560
classmates.

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:35.379
Studies suggest that using sarcasm can significantly
improve your I.Q.

00:00:35.379 --> 00:00:43.190
Fifteen percent of the air you breathe in
a subway station is human skin.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:50.870
Undertakers have found that human bodies do
not decompose as quickly as they used to.

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:56.960
They believe the reason is because the modern
diet contains so many preservatives that they

00:00:56.960 --> 00:01:01.019
delay decomposition after death.

00:01:01.019 --> 00:01:07.930
Michael Jordan earns more money from Nike
every year than all of the Nike factory workers

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.560
in Malaysia combined.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:17.990
There are more lifeforms living on your skin
than there are people on the planet.

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:25.180
In the 1960s, the CIA attempted to spy on
Russian embassies and the Kremlin by turning

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.970
cats into listening devices.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:34.860
The program, called Acoustic Kitty, involved
surgically implanting batteries, microphones

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.579
and antennae inside cats.

00:01:37.579 --> 00:01:42.909
An ostrich's eye is bigger than its brain.

00:01:42.909 --> 00:01:51.630
In the 1800s feeding lobster to prisoners
was considered a "cruel and unusual punishment,

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:54.290
like making people eat rats."

00:01:54.290 --> 00:01:59.930
A hummingbird weighs less than a penny.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:06.180
There are only two beret factories remaining
in France.

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:14.670
There's an 80% chance that if you're 16 or
older, you've already met the person you'll

00:02:14.670 --> 00:02:16.560
marry.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:24.050
If the Simpsons aged at a normal rate Bart
would now be older than Marge was in the first

00:02:24.050 --> 00:02:26.540
series.

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:32.250
Most antibiotics are made from bacteria.

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:43.620
You're more likely to become the president
of the United States than to win the lottery.

